# VibeChat 的部署配置。复制成同一目录下的 .env 再填写：cp env.example .env
# 说明见 docs/deploy.md（中文）、docs/deploy.en.md（English）。
# Copy to .env in this directory and fill in. See docs/deploy.en.md.

# ---------- 必填 / Required ----------

# 网页入口的站点。有域名时写域名（自动申请 HTTPS 证书）；只有 IP 时写 :80
# The site: your domain name (automatic HTTPS), or :80 when you only have an IP address
SITE=chat.example.com

# 用户在浏览器里打开的地址，要和上面一致：https://域名，或 http://IP
# The address people open in the browser: https://your-domain, or http://your-ip
PUBLIC_URL=https://chat.example.com

# 第一名管理员（ID 是 admin）。只在数据库里还没有管理员时用到，第一次登录后必须改密码
# The first administrator (ID "admin"); used only while there is none. The password must be changed at first login
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD=change-me-now-1

# ---------- 通话（可选，要有域名）/ Calls (optional, needs a domain) ----------
# 填好下面三项，再用 docker compose --profile calls up -d 启动。两个密钥用 openssl rand -hex 32 各生成一个
# Fill these in and start with: docker compose --profile calls up -d. Generate each secret with: openssl rand -hex 32

# 服务器的公网 IP / The server's public IP address
PUBLIC_IP=
# 云服务器上，机器只有内网地址、公网地址由外面映射进来时，填机器的内网地址；否则空着
# On clouds where the machine only has a private address (the public one is mapped in), put the private address here
PRIVATE_IP=
TURN_SECRET=
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=

# ---------- 发信（可选）/ Mail (optional) ----------
# 管理员找回密码、确认邮箱时发邮件用。不填时邮件写在数据卷的 mail 目录里
# Used to mail the administrator (password recovery, email confirmation). Without it mail is written to the mail folder in the data volume
# 例如 / e.g. smtps://user:password@smtp.example.com:465
SMTP_URL=
MAIL_FROM=

# ---------- PostgreSQL（可选）/ PostgreSQL (optional) ----------
# 默认用 SQLite 就够了。要用 PostgreSQL：填密码，打开下面的 DATABASE_URL，用 --profile postgres 启动
# SQLite is enough by default. For PostgreSQL: set a password, uncomment DATABASE_URL, start with --profile postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://vibechat:同上的密码@postgres:5432/vibechat
